d",null,{"children":["Bound on the number of payload bytes waiting in the coalescer queue. When exceeded, new read requests bypass batching and fall back to the regular ",["$","code",null,{"children":"ByteStream"}]," ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Read"}]," path instead of blocking."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
